<title>POLAND: ELPO Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELPO Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elpo preliminary results for</p>
<p>the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 0.23 vs	0.27</p>
